# The lightweight shell (docs/m1-shell.md): the image has no launcher,
# SystemUI or wallpaper.

on early-init
    # ActivityManagerService enables the platform's placeholder home,
    # SystemUserHomeActivity: boot completion waits for a HOME activity.
    setprop ro.system_user_home_needed true
    # No WMShell, so no window decoration draws a caption in a freeform
    # task: aim-windows reports none, and the Mac's title bar is its own.
    setprop ro.vendor.aim.freeform_caption_dp 0
